Package: warcraft
Type: Package
Title: warcraft mode
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-01
Authors@R: person("Michael W.", "Kearney", "", "mkearney@ku.edu", c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Plays audio from the game warcraft while you work. Tasks that
    cost real CPU time get a "job's done", tasks that fail get an annoyed
    orc, and the rest is random peon chatter. Also provides on-demand
    playback for announcing the end of long-running jobs.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.1.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: TRUE
URL: https://github.com/mkearney/warcraft
BugReports: https://github.com/mkearney/warcraft/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
